# 6. AI Orchestration Core

This is where ALKEM begins to add product value beyond a provider abstraction.

Future package concept:

```text
alkem-core
```

Responsibilities:

- choose an AI capability/provider;
- invoke models;
- construct model context;
- apply policies;
- route requests;
- support fallback;
- expose higher-level application operations.

Example future API:

```text
AIEngine.generate(...)
AIEngine.stream(...)
AIEngine.embed(...)
```

The application should usually interact with `AIEngine`, not directly with vendor adapters.

Provider Gateway remains available independently for lower-level usage.

