# 8. Context & Prompt Assembly

This component builds the input sent to a model.

Responsibilities may eventually include:

- system instructions;
- conversation history;
- retrieved knowledge;
- selected source files;
- tool results;
- token/context budgeting.

Conceptually:

```text
ContextBuilder
       │
       ├── instructions
       ├── conversation
       ├── memories
       ├── retrieved documents
       └── tool outputs
       │
       ▼
CompletionRequest
```

Provider Gateway must not know where context originated.

