# 9. Knowledge / RAG

Separate from provider access.

Pipeline:

```text
Document
    ↓
Loader
    ↓
Chunker
    ↓
EmbeddingProvider
    ↓
Vector Store
    ↓
Retriever
    ↓
Relevant Context
    ↓
Context Builder
```

Initial target use case:

> Add a PDF/book/document collection and ask questions using that material as contextual knowledge.

Initial implementation should favor simplicity over scalability.

Potential first vector store:

- in-memory or lightweight local persistence.

Do not introduce distributed vector infrastructure for the prototype.

