# 11. Tools

Future models may request execution of deterministic capabilities.

Examples:

```text
read file
search repository
inspect symbol
run tests
retrieve documentation
```

Architecture:

```text
Model
  ↓ tool request
Tool Registry
  ↓
Tool Executor
  ↓
Tool Result
  ↓
Model
```

Security boundary is important.

AI-generated requests must never imply unrestricted execution.

