# 18. Architectural decision records

Important design choices should be recorded as lightweight ADRs.

Initial ADR candidates:

```text
ADR-001 — Ports & Adapters for provider integration
ADR-002 — Capability-specific provider protocols
ADR-003 — Provider-neutral domain entities
ADR-004 — RAG outside Provider Gateway
ADR-005 — Local inference as a first-class capability
```

Each ADR should contain:

```text
Context
Decision
Alternatives considered
Consequences
```

Keep ADRs short.

